{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"authoring","lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"在有序数组中用二分查找找到 23","goals":["理解二分查找中的 low、mid、high","用逐轮表格跟踪查找过程","理解每轮如何排除约一半范围","解释数组为什么必须有序","理解时间复杂度 O(log n)"]},"steps":[{"key":"setup","purpose":"建立数组、下标和二分查找的初始边界。","beats":[{"key":"show-array","say":"我们要在有序数组 [2,5,8,12,16,23,38] 中查找 23。先把元素和下标对齐，后面用下标记录查找范围。","delivery":"neutral","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"array","kind":"table","role":"ordered-array","content":{"title":"有序数组","columns":["下标","0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"rows":[["元素","2","5","8","12","16","23","38"]]},"place":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"main","align":"center"}},{"do":"write","when":"after_speech","as":"target","kind":"note","role":"search-target","content":{"text":"目标值：23"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"array","align":"start","gap":"normal"}}]},{"key":"define-bounds","say":"low 指向当前范围最左端，high 指向最右端，mid 取中间下标。初始时 low=0、high=6，mid=floor((0+6)/2)=3。","delivery":"careful","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"bounds-rule","kind":"math","role":"boundary-definition","content":{"lines":["low = 当前范围的最左下标","high = 当前范围的最右下标","mid = floor((low + high) / 2)"]},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"array","align":"start","gap":"spacious"}},{"do":"write","when":"after_speech","as":"initial-state","kind":"math","role":"initial-state","content":{"text":"low=0，mid=3，high=6"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"bounds-rule","align":"start","gap":"compact"}}]}]},{"key":"trace","purpose":"用逐轮表格展示边界、比较结果和范围缩小过程。","beats":[{"key":"table-header","say":"现在建立逐轮表格。每一行都记录 low、mid、high、中间值、比较结果和下一步。","delivery":"neutral","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"trace-header","kind":"table","role":"trace-table-header","content":{"title":"二分查找逐轮记录","columns":["轮次","low","mid","high","array[mid]","比较","下一步"]},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"target","align":"start","gap":"spacious"}}]},{"key":"round-one","say":"第 1 轮，low=0、mid=3、high=6，中间值是 12。因为 12<23，而且数组递增，所以 23 只可能在 mid 右侧；下标 0 到 3 被排除，下一轮令 low=4。","delivery":"careful","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"round-one-row","kind":"table","role":"trace-row","content":{"rows":[["1","0","3","6","12","12 < 23","排除下标 0..3；low=4"]]},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"trace-header","align":"start","gap":"compact"}},{"do":"write","when":"after_speech","as":"round-one-range","kind":"diagram","role":"remaining-range","content":{"excluded":["2","5","8","12"],"remaining":["16","23","38"],"caption":"排除左侧及 mid，保留右侧"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"round-one-row","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"emphasize","when":"after_speech","target":"round-one-range","emphasis":"突出剩余范围 [16,23,38]"}]},{"key":"round-two","say":"第 2 轮，范围是下标 4 到 6，所以 low=4、high=6，mid=floor((4+6)/2)=5。array[5]=23，正好等于目标值，于是在下标 5 找到 23。","delivery":"encouraging","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"round-two-row","kind":"table","role":"trace-row","content":{"rows":[["2","4","5","6","23","23 = 23","找到；下标 5"]]},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"round-one-row","align":"start","gap":"compact"}},{"do":"write","when":"after_speech","as":"found-result","kind":"note","role":"result","content":{"text":"找到 23：下标 5，共比较 2 轮"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"round-two-row","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"emphasize","when":"after_speech","target":"found-result","emphasis":"突出查找成功和下标 5"}]},{"key":"group-trace","say":"两行合起来就是完整轨迹：先比较 12 并排除左侧，再比较 23 并找到目标。","delivery":"neutral","actions":[{"do":"group","when":"before_speech","as":"trace-rows","role":"complete-trace","label":"完整的两轮查找轨迹","members":["trace-header","round-one-row","round-two-row"]},{"do":"focus","when":"during_speech","targets":["trace-rows"],"intent":"依次查看第 1 轮排除左侧和第 2 轮找到目标"}]}]}],"close":{"summary":"在两轮比较后，于下标5找到目标值23。","focus":["trace-rows","found-result"]}}
